WEBVTT

01:28.581 --> 01:32.131
Our Secret
EP20

01:40.001 --> 01:41.001
Thank you.

01:44.001 --> 01:45.751
The end-of-the-world fireworks

01:46.920 --> 01:49.561
gave me a reason to apply for Hua Qing University again.

02:48.601 --> 02:49.401
Tomorrow

02:50.911 --> 02:52.960
is the opening exhibition of the robotics competition.

02:53.431 --> 02:54.601
Would you like to come?

02:56.431 --> 02:57.991
Don't push your luck here.

02:58.991 --> 03:00.321
We had a deal today.

03:01.121 --> 03:03.151
Hanging out together was an accident.

03:03.791 --> 03:04.631
Well then,

03:05.551 --> 03:07.201
you are gonna have to hang on a little longer,

03:08.271 --> 03:09.911
cause I'm not giving up.

03:12.041 --> 03:12.841
Xianxian.

03:14.431 --> 03:15.201
Su.

03:15.511 --> 03:16.551
What are you doing here?

03:17.121 --> 03:18.601
I tried to find you in your room.

03:18.601 --> 03:19.791
Your roommate said you were out.

03:19.791 --> 03:20.911
It was raining outside.

03:21.351 --> 03:22.321
Hope you didn't get caught in the rain.

03:22.791 --> 03:23.681
With me around,

03:23.681 --> 03:24.710
she won't.

03:29.710 --> 03:32.041
Am I interrupting something?

03:32.431 --> 03:33.351
No.

03:33.551 --> 03:34.321
A little bit.

03:35.041 --> 03:37.991
Well, how about you give us a minute, then?

03:39.911 --> 03:40.881
Sorry.

03:41.271 --> 03:42.761
There's something about work

03:42.761 --> 03:44.041
to discuss with Xianxian.

03:44.991 --> 03:46.631
She's getting a little tired.

03:46.881 --> 03:48.791
What about another day.

03:52.551 --> 03:53.960
Su, it's okay.

03:54.151 --> 03:55.841
What do you need me for?

03:58.151 --> 03:58.991
Let's find a quiet place,

03:58.991 --> 04:00.710
that we can sit down to talk.

04:01.121 --> 04:01.991
Okay.

04:02.551 --> 04:03.321
Let's go.

04:10.151 --> 04:11.711
Xianxian, look over this.

04:14.991 --> 04:15.881
This is...

04:29.951 --> 04:31.391
You're everywhere!

04:31.711 --> 04:32.711
Good point.

04:34.601 --> 04:36.671
What's wrong with me being a customer here?

04:52.801 --> 04:53.521
Xianxian,

04:53.521 --> 04:55.991
There was this comic book company in the Huai city,

04:55.991 --> 04:57.521
who asked us to design an app.

04:57.761 --> 04:59.671
It's almost done

04:59.831 --> 05:00.951
and is about to be launched.

05:01.921 --> 05:03.431
The Director Zhang of the comic book company,

05:03.601 --> 05:04.991
asked me if I could recommend an artist.

05:05.231 --> 05:06.391
And I thought of you.

05:08.041 --> 05:11.231
Tech companies make comic book apps, too?

05:11.831 --> 05:13.601
Your company really does everything.

05:14.201 --> 05:15.801
Yeah, because we are a startup company.

05:16.041 --> 05:18.271
The boss wants to try various services.

05:19.711 --> 05:20.921
He's got foresight.

05:22.111 --> 05:23.201
Thank you.

05:23.361 --> 05:24.271
If he doesn't,

05:24.551 --> 05:26.671
he wouldn't send me here to cooperate with Xianxian.

05:27.551 --> 05:28.951
You're right about that.

05:29.951 --> 05:31.431
That could be the only common point

05:31.431 --> 05:33.201
that we share.

05:33.991 --> 05:35.111
But,

05:35.801 --> 05:38.551
I have no experience in

05:38.761 --> 05:40.521
working on comic book apps like this.

05:40.881 --> 05:41.951
Don't worry about this.

05:42.231 --> 05:44.361
This app is currently the first one in China.

05:44.361 --> 05:46.391
and the only professional platform exclusively for comics.

05:46.951 --> 05:48.271
I think it's quite good.

05:48.551 --> 05:50.481
I wonder if you're interested.

05:50.801 --> 05:52.951
So what do I need to do?

05:54.481 --> 05:55.921
It happens that we are currently in the Huai City,

05:56.231 --> 05:57.551
if you're interested,

05:57.801 --> 05:59.951
come with me to see director Zhang tomorrow.

06:00.831 --> 06:04.081
Tomorrow? Tomorrow is probably not okay.

06:05.761 --> 06:06.711
Are you...

06:08.321 --> 06:09.521
Are you going to see him?

06:11.671 --> 06:12.601
No.

06:13.201 --> 06:16.231
The show-stand for our comic club needs to be prepared tomorrow.

06:16.671 --> 06:18.391
I'm afraid I can't make time.

06:19.431 --> 06:20.271
Then...

06:20.951 --> 06:22.601
I'll make arrangement when you are free.

06:22.711 --> 06:24.711
That's great. Thank you, Su.

06:25.111 --> 06:26.041
So I'll take my leave now.

06:26.231 --> 06:27.921
I have to work on my sketch tonight.

06:28.551 --> 06:29.711
Let me walk you to your place.

06:37.481 --> 06:40.761
Don't we all stay in the same hotel here?

07:01.641 --> 07:03.951
See you then. You don't have to walk me there.

07:05.551 --> 07:06.391
Wait a minute.

07:07.321 --> 07:09.481
I need to talk to you.

07:13.361 --> 07:15.041
Could you please give us some privacy?

07:23.271 --> 07:24.041
Su,

07:24.431 --> 07:26.951
how about you go first?

07:30.881 --> 07:31.641
Okay.

07:31.831 --> 07:33.081
Remember to rest early.

07:33.431 --> 07:34.431
If there's anything,

07:34.951 --> 07:35.671
call me at any time.

07:35.671 --> 07:37.111
Okay, Su, bye.

07:37.271 --> 07:38.081
Bye.

07:38.881 --> 07:40.151
Good night.

07:45.481 --> 07:46.391
Go ahead.

07:48.321 --> 07:49.361
To be honest,

07:50.361 --> 07:52.231
I don't like this guy very much.

07:54.321 --> 07:55.201
But,

07:56.321 --> 07:57.711
what he just said,

07:58.801 --> 08:00.761
sounds like a good opportunity.

08:00.991 --> 08:02.801
It’s worth your consideration.

08:06.151 --> 08:07.951
You chose to do what you love,

08:09.201 --> 08:10.601
I'll definitely stand behind you.

08:17.831 --> 08:19.321
Then I'll go back to my room.

08:28.041 --> 08:30.761
Don't forget to come to the robot exhibition opening tomorrow.

08:30.991 --> 08:32.711
I'll be waiting for you.

08:42.430 --> 08:43.641
Did you two make up?

08:45.521 --> 08:47.591
We were never together.

08:47.591 --> 08:48.761
There can't be "make up".

08:51.471 --> 08:52.761
Forget about that.

08:53.431 --> 08:54.881
You betrayed me!

08:57.521 --> 08:59.031
You've been in the amusement park all day,

08:59.401 --> 09:01.351
and earned a course from Professor Ye.

09:02.521 --> 09:03.591
Couldn't ask for more.

09:16.281 --> 09:17.351
Xianxian's not here yet?

09:19.161 --> 09:20.911
How could it be？ It's late already.

09:25.231 --> 09:26.161
Hurry up.

09:33.161 --> 09:34.111
Lou Feng.

09:34.351 --> 09:35.551
You put this here first,

09:35.551 --> 09:37.161
then go upstairs to get tomorrow's schedule.

09:37.591 --> 09:39.551
And you need to check out tomorrow's costumes in the dressing room.

09:40.231 --> 09:42.231
I have to go to the dressing room?

09:42.761 --> 09:44.201
I'll go to the dressing room.

09:44.431 --> 09:45.961
My work is done here anyway.

09:46.161 --> 09:48.401
You're not going to the robot contest opening?

09:48.551 --> 09:50.961
No time for chat. Just move.

09:51.401 --> 09:52.991
Okay, see you then!

09:53.201 --> 09:54.281
Xianxian, I love you!

09:54.641 --> 09:56.231
Get the schedule, hurry up.

10:09.671 --> 10:11.961
Sir, this truck is ready to go!

10:12.551 --> 10:13.791
Are you guys ready?

10:14.031 --> 10:14.641
In a minute,

10:14.641 --> 10:16.471
everyone's going to the central exhibition hall to give speeches.

10:16.841 --> 10:17.991
Could you wait a couple minutes?

10:18.161 --> 10:19.591
We need a few more minutes.

10:19.961 --> 10:22.111
How many plans are you gonna show?

10:22.991 --> 10:25.591
Let's go with one first.

10:26.201 --> 10:27.081
Are you doing this or not?

10:30.201 --> 10:31.351
You can start the show now.

10:31.721 --> 10:32.791
Don't wait for me.

10:37.351 --> 10:38.281
I'm sorry.

10:41.231 --> 10:42.351
Without Xianxian,

10:42.521 --> 10:44.841
you can still give the show of your robot.

10:46.321 --> 10:47.431
Without her here,

10:47.881 --> 10:49.671
there is no point in doing the show anymore.

10:51.401 --> 10:53.161
Why don't you just go inside? It's fine.

11:05.281 --> 11:07.991
So, one two three four five six...

11:15.991 --> 11:16.991
Why is it locked?

11:20.201 --> 11:23.231
I'll go to the dressing room. My work is done here anyway.

11:29.521 --> 11:30.761
Anyone out there?

11:32.081 --> 11:34.081
Someone's in here!

11:35.591 --> 11:36.911
Good work. See you guys.

11:37.111 --> 11:38.551
Bye! Bye!

11:40.111 --> 11:42.161
Xing Lufei, I got the schedule.

11:44.281 --> 11:45.031
Good.

11:45.351 --> 11:46.591
Then we're done here today.

11:46.961 --> 11:47.841
Good work.

11:48.471 --> 11:49.321
So...

11:50.201 --> 11:51.111
Where's Ding Xian?

11:53.281 --> 11:54.401
Ding Xian is...

11:54.591 --> 11:56.281
She went to check out the dressing room,

11:56.591 --> 11:59.721
and then I think there's something urgent, and she just left.

12:00.351 --> 12:01.351
Then I'll see you.

12:02.321 --> 12:03.201
Bye.

12:04.201 --> 12:05.081
Something urgent?

12:18.671 --> 12:19.591
Boss,

12:20.161 --> 12:21.551
The opening ceremony is over.

12:21.881 --> 12:23.761
I don't think Xianxian will come.

12:24.201 --> 12:25.471
Why don't we just go?

12:26.401 --> 12:28.351
It's okay. You can go.

12:28.591 --> 12:29.431
You don't have to wait for me.

12:31.761 --> 12:33.431
Okay, don't be too late.

12:35.991 --> 12:36.911
No worries.

12:51.111 --> 12:55.351
Sir, why do you have Ding Xian's cell phone?

12:56.791 --> 12:58.161
Oh, I'll fetch it right away.

12:58.911 --> 13:00.321
Wasn't she with you?

13:00.721 --> 13:01.671
Don't tell me she is...

13:02.911 --> 13:04.761
still at the Comic-Con Center.

13:13.401 --> 13:14.321
Ding Xian!

13:16.591 --> 13:17.551
Ding Xian!

13:21.841 --> 13:22.591
Ding Xian!

13:24.671 --> 13:25.841
Ding Xian!

13:27.231 --> 13:28.231
Zhou Siyue!

13:30.721 --> 13:31.791
Zhou Siyue!

13:33.471 --> 13:35.591
Zhou Siyue, I'm here!

13:36.111 --> 13:36.961
Ding Xian!

13:37.961 --> 13:40.161
I'm here. Can you hear me?

13:40.161 --> 13:41.841
Ding Xian, are you in there?

13:42.401 --> 13:44.321
I'm locked inside!

13:50.031 --> 13:51.161
You step back a little!

13:52.161 --> 13:53.281
Step back, okay?

14:00.841 --> 14:01.911
Are you all right?

14:04.671 --> 14:05.641
I'm okay.

14:14.201 --> 14:15.031
Come.

14:19.081 --> 14:20.281
Getting in here like this,

14:20.471 --> 14:22.201
are you sure we won't get caught?

14:23.201 --> 14:24.471
It's an emergency after all.

14:25.721 --> 14:26.721
Just give me a second.

14:33.031 --> 14:35.081
How did you get locked up in there?

14:35.791 --> 14:36.961
I have no idea.

14:37.961 --> 14:39.911
You have to be more careful from now on.

14:40.761 --> 14:42.111
If I'm not around someday,

14:42.111 --> 14:43.111
what should you then?

14:44.161 --> 14:45.081
Well...

14:45.961 --> 14:48.431
I'm sure I'll get out the next day.

14:48.641 --> 14:50.961
I could just wait for someone to open the door for me.

14:51.671 --> 14:52.841
That's enough tough talk.

14:53.791 --> 14:54.841
Oh,

14:55.081 --> 14:57.551
how was your opening ceremony?

14:58.281 --> 14:59.161
I didn't do it.

14:59.551 --> 15:00.401
Why?

15:01.081 --> 15:01.961
Aren't you here,

15:02.521 --> 15:04.671
just for the robot contest?

15:05.641 --> 15:06.761
That's not entirely true.

15:08.671 --> 15:09.841
I'm also here for you.

15:16.721 --> 15:17.961
My little Lord Zhou,

15:18.881 --> 15:21.201
when did you become so unambitious?

15:21.401 --> 15:22.431
That's because,

15:23.791 --> 15:25.231
I am sure enough that

15:26.351 --> 15:29.201
I can get the first place in the contest,

15:29.841 --> 15:32.671
and I will get you too.

15:35.521 --> 15:36.671
I'm leaving.

15:38.961 --> 15:40.841
Why do you hate being with me so much?

15:44.551 --> 15:45.551
Zhou Siyue,

15:46.521 --> 15:48.791
when did you become such a scoundrel?

15:49.081 --> 15:50.961
Maybe you should get to know me better.

15:53.231 --> 15:54.081
Come here.

15:55.881 --> 15:56.671
Come here.

15:58.351 --> 16:00.201
Stay here and don't move.

16:18.081 --> 16:20.111
Fellows, I'm leaving.

16:20.111 --> 16:22.281
I want to go away and look around.

16:22.281 --> 16:24.111
Will you come back?

16:24.111 --> 16:26.521
I'll be back. Bye!

16:26.521 --> 16:27.791
Goodbye!

16:27.791 --> 16:29.911
We'll wait for you to come back!

16:33.841 --> 16:35.551
I'll miss you guys.

16:35.551 --> 16:38.521
Don't you forget to miss me!

16:45.281 --> 16:48.721
Help, help!

16:56.161 --> 16:58.721
He's awake! Yes!

16:58.721 --> 17:00.551
That's great!

17:17.921 --> 17:19.071
I thought

17:19.831 --> 17:21.521
that you never check Weibo.

17:22.441 --> 17:24.071
"Little Monster Dairies"

17:25.521 --> 17:27.441
Catchy name.

17:37.991 --> 17:39.041
Ding Xian,

17:40.191 --> 17:41.401
you once asked me

17:42.351 --> 17:44.041
what is true love.

17:45.231 --> 17:47.231
Now I know the answer.

17:50.281 --> 17:51.831
She seems ordinary

17:53.831 --> 17:55.761
yet day by day I find her even more beautiful

17:57.761 --> 17:58.951
It's like...

17:59.441 --> 18:01.591
she is so stubborn that almost makes in rage

18:03.191 --> 18:04.281
and yet making me feel,

18:05.191 --> 18:07.441
she is the cutest in the world.

18:09.071 --> 18:10.951
It's like knowing that she's lying,

18:11.881 --> 18:13.231
and yet,

18:13.591 --> 18:15.441
I just couldn't spoil her poor acting.

18:18.881 --> 18:19.951
It's like...

18:22.351 --> 18:24.521
always crying like a mess,

18:26.471 --> 18:28.191
and yet she is still attractive.

18:31.191 --> 18:32.921
You're a mess.

18:35.401 --> 18:36.311
Who is that

18:37.881 --> 18:39.041
you are talking about?

18:44.071 --> 18:45.161
Ding Xian,

18:48.351 --> 18:49.641
I love you.

18:52.711 --> 18:54.641
Would you be my girlfriend?

19:15.521 --> 19:16.441
What are you doing here?

19:16.641 --> 19:17.561
Who let you in?

19:25.761 --> 19:27.161
How did you get in here?

19:28.071 --> 19:29.641
Now you people don't even give a shit

19:29.641 --> 19:31.111
about us security guards anymore?

19:31.801 --> 19:32.761
Put down your information!

19:35.681 --> 19:36.591
We're sorry.

19:37.401 --> 19:39.161
I brought her there.

19:39.591 --> 19:41.711
So, it has nothing to do with her.

19:42.921 --> 19:45.311
You young lovers nowadays...

19:45.521 --> 19:47.111
Must you have to seek thrills?

19:47.921 --> 19:49.641
Write. What are you looking at?

19:49.921 --> 19:51.761
Just write, everything!

19:52.801 --> 19:54.521
We're not lovers.

19:54.761 --> 19:56.921
Look at your good-looking face,

19:57.111 --> 19:59.111
how come you can't even get a girl?

20:02.111 --> 20:03.801
I was working on it.

20:04.041 --> 20:06.441
And then you cut me off.

20:07.111 --> 20:08.311
Y'all wait here for a sec.

20:08.401 --> 20:09.311
I'll go for a check.

20:09.471 --> 20:10.881
You can't leave until everything's clear.

20:21.641 --> 20:23.071
You haven't given me an answer yet.

20:26.191 --> 20:27.161
Zhou Siyue,

20:27.951 --> 20:29.161
I'm sorry.

20:30.351 --> 20:33.471
I'm not planning on a relationship, now.

20:37.401 --> 20:38.561
well, you...

20:39.471 --> 20:40.761
you sure can hold a grudge.

20:43.071 --> 20:43.881
Fine,

20:45.281 --> 20:46.591
I'll be waiting for you.

20:48.191 --> 20:50.071
I'll wait for your answer.

20:52.561 --> 20:53.591
Xianxian.

20:55.311 --> 20:56.351
why are you here?

20:57.041 --> 20:57.921
Su.

21:01.281 --> 21:03.191
Mr. Su, what brings you here?

21:03.711 --> 21:04.711
You know them?

21:05.351 --> 21:06.471
They're my friends.

21:07.801 --> 21:08.591
Here.

21:10.521 --> 21:11.311
Thank you.

21:11.311 --> 21:13.311
That's it. You can leave now.

21:13.311 --> 21:14.281
Don't do that again.

21:15.041 --> 21:16.441
Mr. Su, see you then.

21:16.681 --> 21:17.681
Good work.

21:20.441 --> 21:21.991
Why are you here?

21:23.111 --> 21:24.231
The contest starts tomorrow.

21:24.401 --> 21:26.191
I'm here to check the procedures with the organizer.

21:27.591 --> 21:28.681
Are you going back to the hotel?

21:28.831 --> 21:29.761
I can give you a ride.

21:30.191 --> 21:31.111
Sure.

21:31.521 --> 21:32.441
Thank you.

21:45.831 --> 21:46.921
Xianxian,

21:47.281 --> 21:48.921
your mom called me the other day.

21:49.071 --> 21:50.441
She asked me to take good care of you,

21:50.591 --> 21:51.681
since we are both in the Huai City now.

21:52.401 --> 21:53.591
I'm a little busy these days,

21:53.881 --> 21:55.761
when I'm done, I'll take you out for fun.

21:57.521 --> 21:59.071
Mr. Su, you're so busy,

22:00.441 --> 22:02.921
maybe we should forget about these social courtesies.

22:06.111 --> 22:07.281
That's where you're wrong.

22:08.041 --> 22:09.881
For me, Xianxian was never a courtesy.

22:10.471 --> 22:11.881
She always sees me as a brother, too.

22:14.071 --> 22:14.991
Does she?

22:15.471 --> 22:17.711
Then how come I have never heard her mention

22:18.191 --> 22:19.351
you, her big brother?

22:24.711 --> 22:25.761
Maybe it's because you two

22:25.761 --> 22:27.111
were never that close?

22:29.761 --> 22:30.951
It's no wonder that you didn't know.

22:31.951 --> 22:33.111
Of course Xianxian wouldn't tell you.

22:33.921 --> 22:35.711
She wouldn't tell anything to a stranger.

22:36.111 --> 22:38.351
Even if she doesn't tell me anything,

22:38.951 --> 22:40.521
I know what she likes,

22:40.711 --> 22:41.681
and what she dislikes.

23:00.231 --> 23:01.111
Xianxian,

23:01.681 --> 23:03.161
I want to talk to you,

23:03.521 --> 23:04.641
about the comic book app.

23:05.641 --> 23:06.681
What is it?

23:08.521 --> 23:09.711
Do you mind giving us a minute?

23:13.161 --> 23:15.041
It's not a secret.

23:15.401 --> 23:16.641
Can't you talk in front of me?

23:19.681 --> 23:22.041
It's okay, Su. Go ahead.

23:23.471 --> 23:25.191
Director Zhang of the comic book company

23:25.351 --> 23:27.351
saw your works on your Weibo, and liked them very much.

23:27.761 --> 23:29.191
He's having a dinner tomorrow,

23:29.401 --> 23:30.831
and wants to sign the contract with you in person.

23:31.071 --> 23:33.441
That's great. Thank you so much, Su.

23:33.561 --> 23:34.471
I didn't do much.

23:34.471 --> 23:35.591
I just introduced you.

23:35.991 --> 23:37.471
I'll take you shopping for some clothes tomorrow.

23:37.831 --> 23:39.521
It's better to dress formally.

23:40.521 --> 23:42.351
What's wrong with her clothes?

23:48.161 --> 23:49.231
It's okay, Su.

23:49.711 --> 23:50.921
I have clothes.

23:51.231 --> 23:52.071
Don't worry.

23:53.641 --> 23:56.071
Okay then, I'll go with you tomorrow.

23:56.311 --> 23:57.441
Don't be nervous.

23:59.041 --> 24:00.641
Ding Xian won't be nervous.

24:01.071 --> 24:02.591
You don't know her very well.

24:08.711 --> 24:10.071
I'll see you then.

24:17.641 --> 24:18.641
Zhou Siyue,

24:20.041 --> 24:20.951
I have told you,

24:22.801 --> 24:24.441
stay away from Xianxian.

24:26.161 --> 24:27.561
I have told you too,

24:28.471 --> 24:30.281
I won't let go.

24:39.921 --> 24:41.831
So that's all for today's discussion,

24:42.401 --> 24:44.351
I hope that in the contest,

24:44.681 --> 24:45.761
we'll all have a good performance.

24:46.111 --> 24:47.191
Thank you all.

24:53.311 --> 24:54.281
Awake now?

24:57.351 --> 24:58.641
You took notes?

24:59.711 --> 25:00.921
Good for you.

25:01.761 --> 25:03.231
Career, love,

25:03.561 --> 25:04.521
acing in both.

25:08.831 --> 25:10.281
Look at him,

25:10.441 --> 25:12.041
what a social butterfly.

25:12.281 --> 25:13.951
Talking to everyone.

25:17.801 --> 25:20.041
Come on, it's none of your business.

25:21.161 --> 25:22.071
Let's go.

25:22.681 --> 25:23.641
Where are you going?

25:26.641 --> 25:27.801
Comic-Con.

25:28.641 --> 25:29.761
Maybe you shouldn't go.

25:31.711 --> 25:32.591
Why?

25:33.161 --> 25:34.711
Because Xianxian is not there.

25:35.951 --> 25:37.761
How do you know that she's not there?

25:37.951 --> 25:39.471
I asked Lou Feng and she told me.

25:40.711 --> 25:41.681
Then where is she?

25:45.521 --> 25:46.471
She's...

25:46.711 --> 25:49.641
she's taken back to the hotel by Su Bocong.

25:53.641 --> 25:56.191
Xianxian, how was your show today?

25:56.561 --> 25:57.441
It went well.

25:57.591 --> 25:59.041
And there were a lot of people.

25:59.191 --> 26:00.281
I finished just now.

26:01.281 --> 26:02.881
So you haven't eaten all day?

26:03.801 --> 26:05.281
- I'm used to it. I'm not hungry. - Ding Xian!

26:15.471 --> 26:16.951
Why didn't you answer my call?

26:17.831 --> 26:19.281
My cell phone is dead.

26:20.991 --> 26:23.951
Weren't you at the academic conference?

26:24.111 --> 26:25.831
Why are you back so soon?

26:26.281 --> 26:27.441
It's over.

26:28.041 --> 26:29.881
Don't you have a speech to prepare?

26:30.281 --> 26:32.041
I pulled an all-nighter and finished it last night.

26:32.191 --> 26:33.591
Then you should go back to your room and catch some sleep.

26:33.801 --> 26:34.831
What are you doing here?

26:37.041 --> 26:38.711
I wanna see you.

26:42.801 --> 26:45.521
Mr. Zhou, you are really everywhere.

26:45.711 --> 26:46.711
Can't seem to lose you.

26:46.831 --> 26:47.761
Right back at you.

26:48.591 --> 26:49.471
Mr. Su.

26:50.071 --> 26:52.401
You're probably not in a position to laugh at me.

26:59.951 --> 27:01.281
Anyone wants some juice?

27:01.991 --> 27:02.711
- I'll get it. - I'll get it.

27:02.881 --> 27:04.111
No, no, no, I'll go.

27:06.231 --> 27:07.761
- Stay here. - Stay here.

27:09.991 --> 27:11.471
Waiter, a glass of juice please.

27:11.761 --> 27:12.711
What kind of juice would you like?

27:12.951 --> 27:13.881
- Blueberry. - Blueberry.

27:15.711 --> 27:16.591
Hot or cold?

27:16.761 --> 27:17.681
- Cold. - Cold.

27:19.761 --> 27:20.681
And sweetness?

27:20.831 --> 27:21.831
- Full sweetness. - Full sweetness.

27:26.991 --> 27:27.991
One cup?

27:28.471 --> 27:29.471
One cup each.

27:30.161 --> 27:32.561
I'll pay for mine, and he pay by himself.

27:33.281 --> 27:34.311
Okay.

27:44.471 --> 27:45.471
Thank you.

27:51.951 --> 27:54.591
This is too much. I can't drink this much.

28:05.561 --> 28:07.281
Xianxian, you must be hungry.

28:07.521 --> 28:08.951
What about have a dinner together before we go back?

28:09.471 --> 28:10.351
Okay.

28:11.991 --> 28:13.591
Mr. Su, you treated me last time.

28:13.761 --> 28:14.711
I feel quite embarrassed.

28:15.231 --> 28:16.351
I'll pay this time.

28:17.071 --> 28:18.471
I haven't said yes yet.

28:18.471 --> 28:19.311
Sure.

28:19.831 --> 28:21.441
Why don't we call up everyone?

28:21.801 --> 28:23.681
We haven't had dinner together yet in the Huai City, anyway.

28:23.921 --> 28:25.761
I know a place that is quite good.

28:26.351 --> 28:27.441
However,

28:27.991 --> 28:29.761
Mr. Zhou, I'm afraid it's gonna cost you.

28:30.991 --> 28:32.281
Don't worry about me.

28:32.591 --> 28:33.471
You should worry about

28:33.921 --> 28:36.441
whether you stand a chance anymore.

28:40.831 --> 28:41.801
Too sour.

28:50.441 --> 28:51.521
See you around.

29:02.561 --> 29:03.711
You're back.

29:07.231 --> 29:08.111
What is this?

29:08.471 --> 29:09.311
Blueberry juice.

29:09.881 --> 29:11.561
No, thanks. It's too sour.

29:14.281 --> 29:16.831
Rumors had it, two cute guys

29:16.921 --> 29:17.951
went for you at the same time today.

29:19.161 --> 29:20.351
Tell me tell me,

29:20.641 --> 29:23.041
are you super happy today?

29:23.561 --> 29:24.711
How is that possible?

29:25.041 --> 29:26.521
They are two big babies!

29:26.991 --> 29:28.561
I am so annoyed.

29:30.921 --> 29:32.281
Anyway,

29:32.641 --> 29:36.191
I'm still rooting the CP of you and Zhou Siyue.

29:36.951 --> 29:39.281
You liked him for so many years.

29:39.921 --> 29:42.351
If you can't be together,

29:43.471 --> 29:45.281
it'd be such a huge shame.

29:46.921 --> 29:48.071
Actually,

29:49.711 --> 29:51.831
he asked me If I would be his girlfriend.

29:52.711 --> 29:55.351
I almost said yes.

29:56.761 --> 29:58.111
You refused?

29:58.281 --> 29:59.921
I liked him for so many years.

30:00.231 --> 30:02.161
And he's only been after me for a few days.

30:02.351 --> 30:04.351
If I just say yes so easily,

30:04.561 --> 30:05.561
I'll be completely controlled by him

30:05.561 --> 30:06.801
in the future.

30:07.281 --> 30:08.191
You have a point.

30:11.921 --> 30:12.921
But,

30:13.351 --> 30:15.681
I always feel that something is missing

30:15.951 --> 30:17.441
between the two of us.

30:17.991 --> 30:19.161
What is missing?

30:20.071 --> 30:21.071
I don't know.

30:21.711 --> 30:23.441
I can't figure it out.

30:28.111 --> 30:28.881
Is she going?

30:30.471 --> 30:32.681
It's his treat this the evening.

30:33.041 --> 30:34.071
Are you going?

30:34.521 --> 30:37.191
Forget it. I'm not.

30:37.881 --> 30:39.071
Come now!

30:40.521 --> 30:41.831
I'll go out for a while.

30:53.471 --> 30:54.351
Bocong,

30:55.521 --> 30:56.561
why didn't you go inside?

30:57.111 --> 30:58.561
I want to tell you something.

30:59.231 --> 31:00.471
What is it?

31:00.951 --> 31:01.951
Here's the thing.

31:02.471 --> 31:04.071
I know that you like Ding Xian.

31:04.401 --> 31:05.351
I can help you.

31:08.351 --> 31:09.681
Why are you helping me?

31:11.311 --> 31:12.561
For Zhou Siyue?

31:14.161 --> 31:15.991
Well, they're not together yet.

31:16.191 --> 31:17.641
I still have a chance. So do you.

31:26.591 --> 31:27.231
Lou Feng,

31:27.231 --> 31:29.351
did you forget something again?

31:29.351 --> 31:30.351
You're so...

31:33.991 --> 31:35.231
Why are you here?

31:35.801 --> 31:37.191
To take you to dinner.

31:37.351 --> 31:38.311
I'm not hungry.

31:46.281 --> 31:48.351
You don't want to see me?

31:49.041 --> 31:51.801
Don't flatter yourself.

31:53.951 --> 31:56.191
I'm buying dinner for everyone because of you.

31:56.681 --> 31:59.161
I can't believe you're not even coming.

31:59.761 --> 32:01.921
I didn't ask for that.

32:02.561 --> 32:04.471
Anyway, I'll starve myself here if you won't go.

32:05.071 --> 32:06.111
I'm not leaving.

32:08.441 --> 32:09.711
Fine, I'll go.

32:10.231 --> 32:11.111
I'll go eat.

32:17.041 --> 32:18.041
Welcome!

32:19.561 --> 32:20.351
Xianxian.

32:20.681 --> 32:21.281
Here.

32:21.441 --> 32:23.641
Xianxian, this way, I saved you a seat.

32:24.161 --> 32:24.831
Okay.

32:25.231 --> 32:26.521
Zhou Siyue, sit here.

32:29.561 --> 32:30.561
Boss, here.

32:32.641 --> 32:33.641
I'm telling you,

32:33.801 --> 32:35.401
we've been here for so many days,

32:35.641 --> 32:37.401
and didn't get the chance to get together, right?

32:37.681 --> 32:39.521
Today, my boss pays the bill.

32:39.711 --> 32:41.441
Just order anything you want, cheers!

32:41.561 --> 32:42.591
Okay, thank you, Prince Charming.

32:42.711 --> 32:43.991
You're welcome.

32:44.161 --> 32:45.641
Just enjoy yourself.

32:45.831 --> 32:46.831
Here, order the food.

32:52.951 --> 32:54.521
Thank you.

32:58.191 --> 32:59.471
I want this.

33:00.681 --> 33:02.711
Thank you, handsome.

33:04.071 --> 33:06.161
Nice that we're together here today.

33:06.441 --> 33:07.311
Let's not just eat.

33:07.471 --> 33:08.521
How about playing a game?

33:08.991 --> 33:11.311
Which game? Just the one we used to play.

33:11.311 --> 33:12.591
The King game.

33:12.801 --> 33:14.111
I brought the cards. Here.

33:14.351 --> 33:16.561
You are all prepared.

33:16.561 --> 33:17.401
Of course.

33:18.471 --> 33:19.471
Do you know how to play?

33:19.881 --> 33:20.761
I don't know.

33:20.991 --> 33:21.991
Here, I'll deal.

33:22.161 --> 33:22.951
It's okay. I'll teach you.

33:26.711 --> 33:27.711
Pass it on.

33:28.561 --> 33:30.311
First hand, who's the king?

33:31.831 --> 33:32.951
I am the king.

33:33.641 --> 33:34.881
My order is simple.

33:35.161 --> 33:37.281
Give me a toast, and call me gorgeous.

33:37.521 --> 33:38.441
That'll do.

33:38.641 --> 33:40.071
Who do you want? Right. What's the number?

33:40.071 --> 33:41.041
What's the number? What's the number?

33:42.441 --> 33:43.311
Number two.

33:43.441 --> 33:45.191
Number two. Who's number two? Who's number two?

33:45.991 --> 33:46.951
Who is number two?

33:54.191 --> 33:55.231
Gorgeous, to you.

33:55.641 --> 33:56.831
What? I can't hear you.

33:56.831 --> 33:57.641
What?

33:58.711 --> 34:00.641
Ban Jiayu, sorry.

34:00.991 --> 34:03.441
You gorgeous, here to you!

34:04.991 --> 34:06.471
Drink it up! Up, up.

34:07.761 --> 34:09.001
Drink up. You're good.

34:13.721 --> 34:14.751
Well done.

34:14.751 --> 34:15.641
Nice.

34:16.201 --> 34:17.310
Go on, go on.

34:24.201 --> 34:25.681
Who is the king? Who?

34:26.111 --> 34:27.031
I am

34:27.401 --> 34:28.270
the king.

34:31.350 --> 34:34.201
Number three should ask number six a question.

34:34.481 --> 34:35.830
Fine, number three, number six.

34:36.350 --> 34:37.310
I'm number six.

34:37.551 --> 34:38.881
Who's number three? Number three.

34:41.751 --> 34:42.591
Number three.

34:43.641 --> 34:44.511
Number three.

34:44.881 --> 34:45.721
Go ahead and ask.

34:46.551 --> 34:48.001
A question.

34:51.201 --> 34:53.401
Have you done anything bad lately?

34:55.591 --> 34:57.241
What kind of question is that?

34:57.401 --> 34:58.551
You should get punished. Come on.

34:58.551 --> 34:59.751
Are you serious, Zhou Siyue?

35:00.241 --> 35:02.441
You're still holding the grudge about me stealing your chocolate?

35:02.721 --> 35:03.641
That's mean!

35:03.791 --> 35:05.721
That doesn't count. Change the question.

35:07.271 --> 35:08.311
That's fine. I have asked already.

35:08.791 --> 35:10.111
I'll have one myself.

35:10.271 --> 35:11.111
You drink up.

35:11.441 --> 35:12.311
Drink up.

35:13.031 --> 35:14.591
I'm in poor health, don't mess with me.

35:15.641 --> 35:16.641
No problem.

35:17.201 --> 35:18.071
Come on.

35:23.591 --> 35:24.791
So this time, you deal.

35:25.241 --> 35:26.031
Okay.

35:29.441 --> 35:31.511
What kind of question was that?

35:34.961 --> 35:35.921
I'm missing one here.

35:38.791 --> 35:39.881
I suspect that the other day,

35:39.881 --> 35:42.001
it's her who locked you in the dressing room.

35:42.921 --> 35:44.271
No way

35:48.511 --> 35:49.481
I am the king.

35:50.311 --> 35:51.881
Since you are all so uptight,

35:52.311 --> 35:53.831
I'll be the bad guy.

35:54.241 --> 35:57.681
So, number five and number four.

35:58.551 --> 35:59.791
Kiss each other.

36:02.551 --> 36:03.921
Number four, number five.

36:04.111 --> 36:05.441
Number four, number five.

36:05.641 --> 36:06.921
Number four, number five.

36:07.481 --> 36:08.481
Okay, okay,

36:12.641 --> 36:12.921
Who?

36:12.921 --> 36:13.271
Who is it?

36:13.271 --> 36:13.551
Who?

36:13.551 --> 36:13.961
Who is it?

36:17.001 --> 36:19.681
Who? I'm number five. I'll punish myself.

36:22.271 --> 36:23.161
Wait.

36:27.351 --> 36:28.721
Let's drink together.

36:35.751 --> 36:37.161
Drink up, drink up.

36:37.351 --> 36:38.511
Drink up, drink up.

36:38.721 --> 36:40.071
Drink up, drink up.

36:40.271 --> 36:41.681
Drink up, drink up.

36:46.241 --> 36:47.161
You can hold liquor just fine.

36:48.641 --> 36:50.001
Boring, no kiss.

36:50.641 --> 36:51.481
Boring.

36:51.791 --> 36:52.881
One more round, one more round.

36:53.201 --> 36:54.031
Boss, I...

36:57.831 --> 36:58.961
Zhou Siyue, see you.

36:58.961 --> 36:59.751
See you.

37:00.201 --> 37:01.111
Bye!

37:02.271 --> 37:03.441
Thank you, Prince Charming.

37:04.751 --> 37:06.071
Take care of Yuanfang.

37:06.441 --> 37:08.111
Why should I take care of Yuan Fang?

37:11.161 --> 37:12.201
Zhou Siyue,

37:16.401 --> 37:17.441
You should be clear that

37:17.831 --> 37:19.831
she'll live a better life if she is with me.

37:21.721 --> 37:23.481
The point is if she wants or not.

37:24.591 --> 37:25.791
I don't think so.

37:26.311 --> 37:27.441
Give me some time.

37:27.721 --> 37:29.111
I'll make her understand.

37:32.031 --> 37:33.831
That's some wishful thinking of yours.

37:35.111 --> 37:36.311
That's the truth.

37:36.721 --> 37:37.751
So long as she's willing to,

37:37.961 --> 37:39.681
sooner or later, we'll belong with each other.

37:40.111 --> 37:41.031
What about you?

37:42.681 --> 37:44.721
whether you're studying abroad, or finding a job,

37:46.031 --> 37:48.831
you don't really think that your little high school romance,

37:48.831 --> 37:50.441
is enough to get you through all that, do you?

37:54.751 --> 37:55.751
Think it over.

37:59.921 --> 38:01.111
Here's your change, sir.

38:02.681 --> 38:03.511
Thank you.

38:03.721 --> 38:04.481
You're welcome.

38:07.271 --> 38:08.641
Now I declare the robot contest

38:08.641 --> 38:10.551
successfully completed.

38:11.001 --> 38:12.961
In this contest,

38:12.961 --> 38:13.551
we've seen

38:13.551 --> 38:15.881
outstanding students from major universities across the country.

38:16.201 --> 38:18.031
Nanjing University, Heilongjiang University of Science and Technology...

38:18.031 --> 38:19.071
How much longer is this gonna take?

38:19.791 --> 38:20.791
Any minute now.

38:20.961 --> 38:22.241
So now, we're going to announce

38:22.401 --> 38:24.751
the top three of this year's robot contest.

38:25.271 --> 38:27.641
First of all, the champion of this contest,

38:27.641 --> 38:29.881
goes to Zhou Siyue from Hua Qing University.

38:30.071 --> 38:32.031
Let's have Zhou Siyue up the stage for the award.

38:48.111 --> 38:48.961
Thank you.

39:01.311 --> 39:02.241
Hello, everyone.

39:02.401 --> 39:03.921
I am from Hua Qing University.

39:04.071 --> 39:06.071
I'm Zhou Siyue from the research team.

39:12.791 --> 39:13.591
Hello?

39:13.791 --> 39:14.591
Hello?

39:17.271 --> 39:19.271
Siyue, use this one.

39:25.111 --> 39:26.071
- Thank you. - You're welcome.

39:35.551 --> 39:36.351
Liu Xiaofeng.

39:38.001 --> 39:38.921
It's been a while.

39:40.001 --> 39:40.831
Yes, indeed.

39:42.271 --> 39:44.441
You're here representing the University of Science and Technology?

39:45.031 --> 39:45.881
Yeah.

39:46.111 --> 39:47.791
Why did you go to the University of Science and Technology?

39:48.641 --> 39:51.001
I remember you said you wanted to study economics

39:51.351 --> 39:52.351
You remember that?

39:53.241 --> 39:56.441
Actually, I am majoring in computer because of you.

39:58.441 --> 40:00.031
Uh-wait, no, I didn't mean...

40:00.351 --> 40:01.511
Don't get me wrong.

40:01.921 --> 40:03.551
I'm just really grateful to you.

40:04.681 --> 40:06.071
I'm not sure if you remember,

40:06.351 --> 40:07.441
when the college entrance exam was close,

40:07.961 --> 40:09.351
I was very nervous.

40:22.401 --> 40:24.311
The pressure of that last year of high school was too much.

40:25.401 --> 40:27.031
In fact, I am also very confused.

40:27.641 --> 40:29.241
Whether I get in the university or not,

40:29.441 --> 40:31.241
I am not sure what I should do in the future.

40:31.481 --> 40:32.831
What kind of person I want to be.

40:39.111 --> 40:40.351
In this world,

40:41.241 --> 40:44.071
There are many, many hard-working people.

40:44.591 --> 40:45.791
But not everyone

40:45.961 --> 40:47.241
can get what he wants.

40:49.161 --> 40:50.111
But,

40:50.751 --> 40:53.001
if you can't get what you want through hard work,

40:53.721 --> 40:55.481
then what's the point for working hard anyway?

40:58.961 --> 41:00.481
We work hard so we won't regret.

41:02.111 --> 41:03.271
If it wasn't you,

41:03.751 --> 41:06.031
I would have no confidence to go to the college.

41:07.921 --> 41:09.591
That's gross, man.

41:09.881 --> 41:11.511
No, I mean it.

41:12.721 --> 41:13.681
At that time,

41:14.111 --> 41:15.881
I always thought that you were so out of touch.

41:16.791 --> 41:19.031
But ever since you hang around with Ding Xian,

41:19.511 --> 41:22.001
you've got a little more human touch.

41:23.241 --> 41:25.551
Am I this cold-blooded before?

41:25.881 --> 41:26.721
No.

41:27.681 --> 41:28.961
How do I put it? It like...

41:29.401 --> 41:32.001
Maybe I think that's who you really are.

41:35.071 --> 41:36.401
How are you two now?

41:36.751 --> 41:37.881
Are you together?

41:41.961 --> 41:42.961
Not yet.

41:44.161 --> 41:45.241
I'm still waiting for her.

41:46.481 --> 41:48.351
Why wait?

41:49.481 --> 41:51.111
She's been waiting for me all these years.

41:51.791 --> 41:52.591
I...

41:53.161 --> 41:55.881
should give her enough patience too.

41:56.441 --> 41:58.271
But have you ever thought about this,

41:58.831 --> 42:00.481
for a girl as good as her,

42:01.241 --> 42:02.751
she's never short of admirers.

42:07.751 --> 42:08.751
You're right.

42:10.401 --> 42:11.311
Then see you!

42:11.311 --> 42:12.111
Wait.

42:12.721 --> 42:13.551
What are you gonna do?

42:13.831 --> 42:14.721
Go find her.

42:17.351 --> 42:19.311
Hello, hello.

42:19.311 --> 42:21.311
Excuse me, where's Zhou Siyue?

42:22.831 --> 42:24.441
He has some business to attend to and left.

42:24.791 --> 42:25.961
If you have something important,

42:26.161 --> 42:27.161
I can tell him.

42:27.921 --> 42:28.641
Here's the thing.

42:28.961 --> 42:30.591
I want to work with him on a project.

42:30.751 --> 42:31.791
Here is my name card.

42:32.071 --> 42:34.071
Please do give it to him.

42:34.551 --> 42:35.681
Okay, thank you.

42:46.271 --> 42:47.791
- Xianxian. - Su.

42:48.751 --> 42:49.641
Wait a minute.

42:49.791 --> 42:52.071
What's the matter? It's the first time I wear high heels.

42:52.481 --> 42:54.071
Not very used to it.

42:54.351 --> 42:55.401
It's hurting my feet.

43:01.881 --> 43:03.001
You look...

43:03.001 --> 43:03.961
beautiful today.

43:04.071 --> 43:05.511
Really? Yes.

43:06.271 --> 43:07.201
Thank you!

43:12.511 --> 43:13.551
This is for you.

43:15.881 --> 43:16.751
Su.

43:17.071 --> 43:18.441
You've helped me a lot.

43:18.721 --> 43:20.551
I can't take any more gift from you.

43:21.311 --> 43:23.481
And this is too expensive.

43:23.921 --> 43:24.881
Not really.

43:25.111 --> 43:27.351
Just for good luck.

43:27.351 --> 43:29.071
So you could successfully seal the contract tonight.

43:33.241 --> 43:35.031
You're wearing such a beautiful dress,

43:35.831 --> 43:38.071
it should go with a nice necklace.

43:38.401 --> 43:39.961
I can do it myself.

43:47.511 --> 43:48.441
It looks great on you.

43:49.511 --> 43:50.441
Thank you.

43:50.791 --> 43:52.031
If I can seal the contract,

43:52.201 --> 43:53.961
I will buy you a big meal.

43:57.071 --> 43:59.031
I really wish you don't be too polite with me.

44:01.401 --> 44:02.351
Let's go.

44:14.961 --> 44:15.511
Here.

44:16.591 --> 44:17.401
Thank you.

44:17.721 --> 44:18.831
Let's go in.

44:28.111 --> 44:28.721
Director Zhang.

44:30.271 --> 44:31.241
Okay, you can go.

44:34.681 --> 44:35.721
Su, you're here.

44:38.271 --> 44:39.161
This is...

44:39.681 --> 44:41.071
This is the one I told you about before,

44:41.311 --> 44:42.961
the author of the Little Monster Dairies,

44:42.961 --> 44:43.831
Ding Xian.

44:44.111 --> 44:45.071
She's so young!

44:46.161 --> 44:47.551
How do you do, Director Zhang.

44:48.551 --> 44:51.481
First of all, thank you very much for enjoying my comic.

44:51.961 --> 44:54.681
I hope we can have a pleasant collaboration.

44:56.031 --> 44:57.681
About the content of comics,

44:57.681 --> 44:58.831
here's what I think.

44:59.001 --> 45:01.351
I have some new ideas,

45:01.551 --> 45:02.591
and I hope to give you a briefing.

45:02.921 --> 45:04.271
Sure, please.

45:04.721 --> 45:06.001
Here's my idea.

45:06.201 --> 45:08.271
What about making your little monster,

45:08.831 --> 45:10.161
personified.

45:10.551 --> 45:11.831
Then we give the little monster a romance,

45:12.001 --> 45:13.351
and let him fight against evil monsters to level up.

45:14.511 --> 45:16.831
Meanwhile, we lengthen the content.

45:17.921 --> 45:18.921
The audience nowadays,

45:19.201 --> 45:20.641
like that kind of stuff.

45:21.311 --> 45:23.201
By the way, if the contract with this little lady

45:23.831 --> 45:25.201
has no problem,

45:25.441 --> 45:27.751
let's sign it today.

45:28.881 --> 45:30.111
Excuse me, Director Zhang,

45:30.111 --> 45:31.721
I need to go to the bathroom.

45:36.111 --> 45:37.351
Director Zhang, will you excuse me for a moment.

45:37.351 --> 45:38.201
Okay.

45:40.831 --> 45:41.721
Xianxian,

45:46.401 --> 45:47.351
are you all right?

45:48.721 --> 45:49.441
Yeah.

45:50.111 --> 45:51.401
I just find...

45:51.591 --> 45:54.161
this is different than what I thought.

45:54.721 --> 45:55.591
Xianxian,

45:56.161 --> 45:57.351
people in this line of work

45:57.641 --> 45:59.791
only care about maximizing profits,

46:00.071 --> 46:01.831
which might make you a little uncomfortable.

46:03.111 --> 46:03.961
But,

46:04.311 --> 46:06.751
he doesn't even care about my idea about the work,

46:06.751 --> 46:08.681
or the ideas I want to convey.

46:11.401 --> 46:13.031
The two are inherently different.

46:13.721 --> 46:16.071
The comic series that you started out at first was for yourself.

46:16.271 --> 46:17.881
You don't need to care about other people's feelings.

46:18.241 --> 46:19.721
But when it comes to commercial use,

46:20.201 --> 46:23.241
you have to consider whether the public likes it or not.

46:24.001 --> 46:25.681
That's just the way it is.
